{"id":1751772,"retrievedAt":"2026-08-19T11:50:20.906Z","response":{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":null,"belongs_to_collection":null,"budget":0,"genres":[],"homepage":"https://www.broadview.tv/alle-filme/die-kraft-der-koenigin-schwedens-starke-frauen/","id":1751772,"imdb_id":"tt21836870","origin_country":["US"],"original_language":"en","original_title":"Die Kraft der Königin: Schwedens starke Frauen","overview":"Queen Silvia is an icon; Crown Princess Victoria is a superstar. Mother and daughter bring glamour and good news. Constant public scrutiny and a life dictated by others are the price they pay. Would the Swedish monarchy even have a future without them? This film by royal expert Julia Melchior examines the role of strong women in one of Europe’s most popular royal families.  Royals have no power, but they do have influence. Strictly speaking, Queen Silvia, as the wife of the reigning king, is merely the “queen consort.” There is no official job description for First Ladies; representing the monarchy is generally expected. Queen Silvia, however, has filled her role with a mission. She breaks taboos to give a voice to the most vulnerable members of society. With diplomatic skill, she defuses many a precarious situation. And with courage and poise, she also overcomes challenges within her own family.","popularity":0.0071,"poster_path":"/lkMSts8y8FzDN6JlIrAE0zseu9C.jpg","production_companies":[{"id":4606,"logo_path":"/otZHbf1HmzLRQsZFSqJXkf8EHz7.png","name":"ZDF","origin_country":"DE"},{"id":70551,"logo_path":"/9X52qZHMbEBRyz7ReQY61TPVzOY.png","name":"Broadview TV","origin_country":"DE"}],"production_countries":[],"release_date":"2023-01-18","revenue":0,"runtime":43,"softcore":false,"spoken_languages":[],"status":"Released","tagline":"","title":"Die Kraft der Königin: Schwedens starke Frauen","video":false,"vote_average":0,"vote_count":0,"alternative_titles":{"titles":[]},"credits":{"cast":[{"adult":false,"gender":1,"id":2057320,"known_for_department":"Acting","nam